<idea-plugin require-restart="true">
  <id>org.konaframework.idea</id>
  <name>Kona</name>
  <vendor url="https://github.com/konaframework/kona-idea">Kona Framework</vendor>
  <description><![CDATA[
    <p>Kona Framework IDE support in IDEA.</p>
    <p>Native support for the <b>Kona Framework</b> in IntelliJ IDEA Community and Ultimate, 2024.2 and later. Crema views, Brew, Inertia, Cadence, and Grind are edited with IntelliJ platform completion, navigation, and inspections. This plugin does not use a language server.</p>
    <ul>
      <li><b>Crema</b> — <code>*.crema.html</code> and <code>*.crema.kt</code>, with HTML colors plus directive and echo overlays. Type <code>@</code> to complete directives. Complete <code>&lt;x-*&gt;</code> and <code>&lt;brew:*&gt;</code> component tags. Inline Brew strings (<code>@CremaTemplate</code> / <code>template()</code> / <code>// language=Crema</code>) get the same Crema highlighting and completion inside Java and Kotlin.</li>
      <li><b>Brew</b> — <code>&lt;brew:component /&gt;</code> tags from <code>app.brew</code>; Ctrl+B on the tag opens the component class; tag attributes complete from properties / <code>mount</code> params; <code>wire:*</code> and <code>{{ }}</code> navigate and complete from the component (or the host class for injected <code>template()</code> strings, or controller <code>mapOf</code> keys on page views).</li>
      <li><b>Kona Project View</b> — default Project tool window view for Kona apps (scaffold folders: <code>app</code>, <code>routes</code>, <code>resources</code>, …); still available beside Project / Packages.</li>
      <li><b>Views and Inertia</b> — page-name completion for <code>Crema.view</code>, <code>Brew.view</code>, and <code>Inertia.render</code>. <b>Ctrl+B</b> or Ctrl+Click opens the file (⌘B on macOS).</li>
      <li><b>Env</b> — key completion for <code>Env.get</code> / <code>getOrDefault</code> / <code>require</code>; value completion for known option-like keys (<code>DB_CONNECTION</code>, log drivers, session/cache/queue, booleans, <code>APP_ENV</code>, …) in <code>.env</code> / <code>.env.*</code> and <code>getOrDefault</code> defaults.</li>
      <li><b>Cadence</b> — on a model instance (<code>user.</code>), complete DB columns, fillable/casts, accessors, and relations; the same keys inside <code>getAttribute("…")</code> / <code>get("…")</code> / <code>user["…"]</code> (and with the caret still inside empty parentheses). Column strings in <code>User.where("…")</code> still complete from migrations and, when <code>.env</code> can connect, from the database. Pick the source in <b>Settings → Tools → Kona</b>.</li>
      <li><b>Grind</b> — run configurations and the <b>Kona</b> tool window on the right. <code>Grind.call("…")</code> / <code>callSilently</code> complete built-in and custom command names. <code>./grind serve</code> uses Netty on port <code>4000</code>.</li>
      <li><b>Templates</b> — file and live templates for typed Router handlers, Cadence, Auth, disks, Queue, Schedule, Crema, and Inertia.</li>
    </ul>
    <p><b>Getting started</b></p>
    <ol>
      <li>Install <b>Kona</b> from the Marketplace, or download the zip from <a href="https://github.com/konaframework/kona-idea/releases">GitHub Releases</a> and choose <b>Settings → Plugins → ⚙ → Install Plugin from Disk…</b>.</li>
      <li>Restart IntelliJ IDEA. Installing, updating, or removing this plugin requires a restart.</li>
      <li>Open a Kona application and a view under <code>src/main/resources/views</code> (<code>*.crema.html</code>). The editor language is <b>Crema</b>.</li>
      <li>Type <code>@</code> in the view for directives, <code>&lt;brew:</code> for Brew components, or <code>wire:</code> on a tag for Brew attributes. Inside <code>wire:submit=""</code> / <code>wire:model=""</code> or <code>{{ }}</code>, complete actions and properties from the paired Brew component. The same completion works inside an inline <code>template()</code> text block annotated <code>@CremaTemplate</code> or preceded by <code>// language=Crema</code>.</li>
      <li>In the Project tool window, the <b>Kona</b> scaffold folder tree is selected by default for Kona apps (you can still switch to Project / Packages).</li>
      <li>Open the <b>Kona</b> tool window on the right and choose <b>Serve (Netty :4000)</b>.</li>
      <li>Put the caret on a view-name string and press <b>Ctrl+B</b> (⌘B on macOS) to open that file.</li>
      <li>Optional: <b>Settings → Tools → Kona</b> sets column completion to migrations, a database connection, or both.</li>
    </ol>
    <p>Guide: <a href="https://docs.konaframework.dev/docs/language/intellij">IntelliJ</a>. Framework: <a href="https://github.com/konaframework/kona">konaframework/kona</a>. Issues: <a href="https://github.com/konaframework/kona-idea/issues">kona-idea</a>.</p>
  ]]></description>

  <!-- idea = IntelliJ IDEA only (Community + Ultimate). platform would list every JetBrains IDE. -->
  <depends>com.intellij.modules.idea</depends>
  <depends>com.intellij.modules.xml</depends>

  <extensions defaultExtensionNs="com.intellij">
    <fileType
        name="Crema"
        implementationClass="org.konaframework.idea.CremaFileType"
        fieldName="INSTANCE"
        language="Crema"
        extensions="crema.html;crema.kt"
        patterns="*.crema.html;*.crema.kt"/>

    <fileTypeOverrider implementation="org.konaframework.idea.CremaFileTypeOverrider"/>
    <fileTypeDetector implementation="org.konaframework.idea.CremaFileTypeDetector" order="first"/>

    <lang.parserDefinition language="Crema" implementationClass="org.konaframework.idea.CremaParserDefinition"/>
    <lang.fileViewProviderFactory language="Crema" implementationClass="org.konaframework.idea.CremaFileViewProviderFactory"/>

    <lang.syntaxHighlighterFactory language="Crema" implementationClass="org.konaframework.idea.CremaSyntaxHighlighterFactory"/>
    <editorHighlighterProvider filetype="Crema" implementationClass="org.konaframework.idea.CremaEditorHighlighterProvider"/>

    <typedHandler implementation="org.konaframework.idea.CremaTypedHandler"/>
    <lookup.charFilter implementation="org.konaframework.idea.CremaCharFilter"/>
    <lang.braceMatcher language="Crema" implementationClass="org.konaframework.idea.CremaBraceMatcher"/>
    <languageInjector implementation="org.konaframework.idea.CremaLanguageInjector"/>

    <configurationType implementation="org.konaframework.idea.GrindConfigurationType"/>
    <postStartupActivity implementation="org.konaframework.idea.KonaProjectOpenActivity"/>
    <iconProvider implementation="org.konaframework.idea.KonaFolderIconProvider"/>
    <projectViewPane implementation="org.konaframework.idea.KonaProjectViewPane"/>
    <fileTemplateGroup implementation="org.konaframework.idea.KonaFileTemplates"/>
    <defaultLiveTemplates file="/liveTemplates/Kona.xml"/>

    <projectConfigurable
        parentId="tools"
        instance="org.konaframework.idea.KonaConfigurable"
        id="org.konaframework.idea.settings"
        displayName="Kona"/>

    <completion.contributor language="any" implementationClass="org.konaframework.idea.CremaCompletionContributor" order="first"/>
    <completion.contributor language="any" implementationClass="org.konaframework.idea.XComponentCompletionContributor" order="first"/>
    <completion.contributor language="any" implementationClass="org.konaframework.idea.BrewTagCompletionContributor" order="first"/>
    <completion.contributor language="any" implementationClass="org.konaframework.idea.BrewTagAttributeCompletionContributor" order="first"/>
    <completion.contributor language="any" implementationClass="org.konaframework.idea.BrewWireCompletionContributor" order="first"/>
    <completion.contributor language="any" implementationClass="org.konaframework.idea.BrewMemberCompletionContributor" order="first"/>
    <completion.contributor language="any" implementationClass="org.konaframework.idea.ViewNameCompletionContributor"/>
    <completion.contributor language="any" implementationClass="org.konaframework.idea.DbColumnCompletionContributor"/>
    <completion.contributor language="any" implementationClass="org.konaframework.idea.ModelPropertyCompletionContributor" order="first"/>
    <completion.contributor language="any" implementationClass="org.konaframework.idea.GrindCallCompletionContributor" order="first"/>
    <annotator language="Crema" implementationClass="org.konaframework.idea.CremaAnnotator"/>
    <annotator language="Crema" implementationClass="org.konaframework.idea.BrewWireAnnotator"/>
    <xml.attributeDescriptorsProvider implementation="org.konaframework.idea.BrewWireAttributeDescriptorsProvider"/>
    <xml.elementDescriptorProvider implementation="org.konaframework.idea.BrewTagDescriptorsProvider"/>
    <xml.tagNameProvider implementation="org.konaframework.idea.BrewTagDescriptorsProvider"/>

    <completion.contributor language="any" implementationClass="org.konaframework.idea.EnvKeyCompletionContributor"/>
    <completion.contributor language="any" implementationClass="org.konaframework.idea.EnvValueCompletionContributor"/>
    <psi.referenceContributor language="any" implementation="org.konaframework.idea.ViewNameReferenceContributor"/>
    <psi.referenceContributor language="any" implementation="org.konaframework.idea.EnvKeyReferenceContributor"/>
    <gotoDeclarationHandler implementation="org.konaframework.idea.ViewGotoDeclarationHandler"/>
    <gotoDeclarationHandler implementation="org.konaframework.idea.EnvGotoDeclarationHandler"/>
    <gotoDeclarationHandler implementation="org.konaframework.idea.BrewTagGotoDeclarationHandler"/>
    <gotoDeclarationHandler implementation="org.konaframework.idea.BrewMemberGotoDeclarationHandler"/>

    <toolWindow
        id="Kona"
        anchor="right"
        icon="/icons/konaToolWindow.svg"
        factoryClass="org.konaframework.idea.KonaToolWindowFactory"
        secondary="false"/>
  </extensions>

  <actions>
    <group id="Kona.Menu"
           text="Kona"
           description="Kona Idea"
           icon="/icons/kona.svg"
           popup="true">
      <add-to-group group-id="MainMenu" anchor="before" relative-to-action="HelpMenu"/>
      <add-to-group group-id="ToolsMenu" anchor="last"/>
      <action id="Kona.ShowLayoutHelp"
              class="org.konaframework.idea.ShowLayoutHelpAction"
              text="Show Project Layout Help"
              description="Canonical kona new / grind scaffold folders and Netty serve"
              icon="/icons/kona.svg"/>
      <action id="Kona.ShowRoutingHelp"
              class="org.konaframework.idea.ShowRoutingHelpAction"
              text="Show Routing Help"
              description="Typed Router handlers (prefer instance/lambda)"
              icon="/icons/kona.svg"/>
      <action id="Kona.ShowArtifactsHelp"
              class="org.konaframework.idea.ShowArtifactsHelpAction"
              text="Show Maven Modules Help"
              description="org.konaframework artifact coordinates"
              icon="/icons/kona.svg"/>
      <action id="Kona.ShowViewNavHelp"
              class="org.konaframework.idea.ShowViewNavHelpAction"
              text="Show View Navigation Help"
              description="Ctrl+B / Ctrl+Click to open Crema views"
              icon="/icons/kona.svg"/>
      <action id="Kona.ShowBrewInertiaHelp"
              class="org.konaframework.idea.ShowBrewInertiaHelpAction"
              text="Show Brew + Inertia Help"
              description="kona-brew wire:* and kona-inertia page templates"
              icon="/icons/kona.svg"/>
    </group>

    <action id="Kona.NewCremaView"
            class="org.konaframework.idea.NewCremaViewAction"
            text="Crema View"
            description="Create a Kona Crema view (*.crema.html)"
            icon="/icons/kona.svg">
      <add-to-group group-id="NewGroup" anchor="first"/>
    </action>
  </actions>
</idea-plugin>
